Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/14] FreeChat: deleted messages leave the database files too

No WAL archive; after messages are purged, all memtables are flushed and the
event maps compacted all the way down, at most daily. There is no server-side
search index: every room is encrypted, and its keys (the words) would outlive
deleted messages in RocksDB's metadata.
